{"lines": ["Summer 1946: two thousand rockets streak across Scandinavia. Nobody ever finds a rocket.", "Sweden's press calls them ghost rockets. Cigar-shaped, some trailing fire.", "July nineteenth, Lake K\u00f6lmj\u00e4rv. Witnesses watch a grey rocket slam into the water.", "Soldiers search three weeks. They find a disturbed lakebed. No wreckage.", "Radar logs about two hundred. Sweden orders newspapers to stop printing where they flew.", "Then America's General Doolittle lands in Stockholm. Officially, on business.", "In October, Sweden's defence staff admits some sightings can't be explained as nature, aircraft, or imagination.", "A secret American review says maybe two or three were real. The rest? Meteors and fireworks.", "So what crossed those skies? Soviet missiles, meteors, or something else? Tell me below."], "words": [["Summer", 0.0, 0.14], ["1946:", 0.14, 0.92], ["two", 1.98, 2.056], ["thousand", 2.056, 2.26], ["rockets", 2.26, 3.0], ["streak", 3.0, 3.68], ["across", 3.68, 4.06], ["Scandinavia.", 4.06, 5.08], ["Nobody", 5.46, 5.78], ["ever", 5.78, 6.14], ["finds", 6.14, 6.58], ["a", 6.58, 6.76], ["rocket.", 6.76, 7.04], ["Sweden's", 7.74, 8.16], ["press", 8.16, 8.34], ["calls", 8.34, 8.78], ["them", 8.78, 9.0], ["ghost", 9.0, 9.28], ["rockets.", 9.28, 9.76], ["Cigar-shaped,", 10.6, 11.1], ["some", 11.1, 11.7], ["trailing", 11.7, 12.0], ["fire.", 12.0, 12.56], ["July", 13.14, 13.28], ["nineteenth,", 13.28, 14.44], ["Lake", 14.46, 14.58], ["K\u00f6lmj\u00e4rv.", 14.58, 15.22], ["Witnesses", 15.78, 16.2], ["watch", 16.2, 16.64], ["a", 16.64, 16.86], ["grey", 16.86, 17.08], ["rocket", 17.08, 17.54], ["slam", 17.54, 17.92], ["into", 17.92, 18.28], ["the", 18.28, 18.44], ["water.", 18.44, 18.72], ["Soldiers", 19.72, 19.76], ["search", 19.76, 20.1], ["three", 20.1, 20.48], ["weeks.", 20.48, 20.76], ["They", 21.3, 21.4], ["find", 21.4, 21.66], ["a", 21.66, 21.82], ["disturbed", 21.82, 22.12], ["lakebed.", 22.12, 22.78], ["No", 23.34, 23.5], ["wreckage.", 23.5, 2